OL,3,GNEWSARush to finish leisure centre
OL,4,Aframe before winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers are "racing against time" to
OL,7,Fget the steel frame of a new leisure
OL,8,Fcentre in place before winter sets in.
OL,10,FThe new centre at West Denton in
OL,11,FNewcastle has been beset by multiple
OL,12,Fsetbacks.
OL,14,FConstruction on the new facility began
OL,15,Fearlier this year and Newcastle City
OL,16,FCouncil recently announced the concrete
OL,17,Fwalls had been finished.
OL,19,FCouncil cabinet member for communities
OL,20,FRob Austin said the "weather has taken
OL,21,Fa turn for the worse" but workers were
OL,22,F"ploughing on".
